fortification.effect:
At the start of battle, gains 3 stacks of Berserk Factor.
The maximum number of Berserk Factor stacks is increased to 20, and after performing an active attack, the number of Berserk Factor stacks gained is additionally increased by 1.
In addition, when Berserk Factor reaches 20 stacks, its effects are enhanced:
Berserk Factor I — when actively attacking an enemy target standing on an phase tile, defense ignore is increased to 20%;
Berserk Factor II — the increase to Freeze damage and Burn damage is raised to 10%;
Berserk Factor III — when attacking an enemy target standing on an phase tile, the damage increase is raised to 30%.
